The fix is to patch the Deployment template to include a non-root `runAsUser` in the container's `securityContext`. Since `busybox` is used, `1000` is a safe, non-root UID.

I will patch the deployment using strategic merge patch to add `runAsUser: 1000` to the container `app`'s `securityContext`.

